      "SummaryOfActivities": "During the 2025 reporting period, Castlemaine Art Museum advanced its mission by delivering exhibitions, public programs, and collection activities that supported access to art and cultural heritage for the Mount Alexander Shire and wider regional community. Through collection care, community engagement, and organisational planning, the Museum strengthened its role as a custodian of cultural heritage and a welcoming civic space for learning, participation, and shared experience.",
